# Fields spike smoke layout: one 3x3-submap region (36x36 tiles), mixed fields.
# Coordinates are region tiles; the centre submap spans x,y 12..23.
region 3 3
ter all t_dirt
# a wall segment so gas spread meets an obstacle
ter 16 14 t_wall
ter 16 15 t_wall
ter 16 16 t_wall
# fields: field <x> <y> <fd_id> <intensity> <age_turns>  (age >= 1: not newborn)
field 17 17 fd_smoke 3 1
field 18 18 fd_tear_gas 2 1
field 14 20 fd_toxic_gas 3 5
field 12 12 fd_fire 2 1
field 13 12 fd_blood 1 1
# on a submap edge, so spread crosses into a neighbour submap
field 23 18 fd_smoke 3 1
